\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Document filter}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{pretraining}
\tag{data}

\p{Let #{\dagger} denote rejection. A \newvocab{document filter} is a
declared map
##{
F:\mathcal D_{\rm doc}\longrightarrow
\mathcal D_{\rm doc}\cup\{\dagger\}.
}
It may retain a document, return a transformed document, or reject it. The
lift #{F_{\#}} applies #{F} to a finite corpus and removes every
#{\dagger}.}

\p{A filter specification includes the features it reads, thresholds,
transformation rules, and implementation revision. An acceptance rate alone
does not determine the retained document law.}
